# "Search your library for a card" has no quality, so any card is a legal find, a land as well as a spell. In Bot2's end
# step Bot1 casts Entomb (an instant, CR 304.1) and takes the Island; on turn 3 it casts the second one and takes the
# Counterspell. Both go to Bot1's graveyard, not Bot2's, and the library shrinks by one each time.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Entomb
Entomb
Swamp x4
Lightning Bolt
Island
Counterspell
Swamp x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T2 Bot2.End]
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Island)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Entomb; Island
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Counterspell)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Entomb; Counterspell; Entomb; Island
Bot1.Library.Count = 8
